  <item>
    <title>Credit Card Payoff Calculator: How Long Will It Take?</title>
    <link>https://jesse-py.github.io/simple-money-sheets/credit-card-payoff-calculator/?utm_source=pinterest&amp;utm_medium=pin&amp;utm_campaign=credit-card-5000</link>
    <description>Paying only the minimum on a $5,000 card at 22% APR takes over 19 years and costs about $8,100 in interest. A fixed $250 a month clears it in 26 months. See your own payoff date and interest, free, no sign-up.</description>
